    <item>
      <title>内存市场将何去何从？分析师争论DRAM和NAND明年会否遇转折点</title>
      <link>https://mirrorinfo.xyz/?batch=smart-20261128-032903&amp;cat=general&amp;event=evt_8adf6f61deb2</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261128-032903:evt_8adf6f61deb2</guid>
